  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your abilities enable you to hold more undead creatures in your thrall.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Spell Focus (necromancy) or Sphere Focus (Death<sup>USoP</sup>), Undead Master<sup>UM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When using the Command Undead feat, you gain the ability to control an additional number of hit dice of creatures equal to your caster level. When using animate dead, you can can control a number of hit dice of creatures equal to 6 times your caster level rather than 4 times.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/arcforge-feats#toc40\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
